lass=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686290/extras/a8e98f37f5ac9b516c63c360831bf094.poster.avif?t=1781067243\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686290/extras/a8e98f37f5ac9b516c63c360831bf094.webm?t=1781067243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686290/extras/a8e98f37f5ac9b516c63c360831bf094.mp4?t=1781067243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Holes:</strong> Use the fabric of the universe to slow time and bring the speed of battle down to your advantage, then, at your will release its power eliminating all in its path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Radicalizations, Perks &amp; Modifiers:</strong> Between each level change the course of this galactic expedition by choosing one of a selection of randomised Perks &amp; Radicalizations. Some modifiers will help and others will hinder ye' little roachs progress towards his goals of vengeance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686290/extras/16fdb7161cd8a65a7a63c6c645a1d7c9.poster.avif?t=1781067243\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686290/extras/16fdb7161cd8a65a7a63c6c645a1d7c9.webm?t=1781067243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/686290/extras/16fdb7161cd8a65a7a63c6c645a1d7c9.mp4?t=1781067243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><